ast" data-show="Duroplast"><option value="">– wählen –</option><option>Thermoplast</option><option>Elastomer</option><option>Duroplast</option></select></span></td></tr><tr><td>schweißbar</td><td><span class="field"><select id="k03-s7" data-check="sel" data-a="Thermoplast" data-show="Thermoplast"><option value="">– wählen –</option><option>Thermoplast</option><option>Elastomer</option><option>Duroplast</option></select></span></td></tr><tr><td>Beispiele: NBR, EPDM</td><td><span class="field"><select id="k03-s8" data-check="sel" data-a="Elastomer" data-show="Elastomer"><option value="">– wählen –</option><option>Thermoplast</option><option>Elastomer</option><option>Duroplast</option></select></span></td></tr><tr><td>Beispiele: EP, UP, PF</td><td><span class="field"><select id="k03-s9" data-check="sel" data-a="Duroplast" data-show="Duroplast"><option value="">– wählen –</option><option>Thermoplast</option><option>Elastomer</option><option>Duroplast</option></select></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><footer class="task-foot"><button type="button" class="btn primary js-check">Prüfen</button><button type="button" class="btn js-solve">Musterlösung zeigen</button><button type="button" class="btn ghost js-reset">Zurücksetzen</button><span class="result" aria-live="polite"></span></footer></article>
